# Project Context

## Overview
DKPrint CRM — operational CRM for a print shop / photo-center network. Spec **v1.5**. Core orders, files (R2), workshop, comments, Telegram live cards, and audit gating are shipped; **tasks** and **reports** remain stubs.

## Tech Stack
- TypeScript (strict), Next.js 16 App Router, React 19
- Auth.js / next-auth v5 (Credentials + JWT)
- Neon Postgres (`@neondatabase/serverless`), Zod, decimal.js
- Tests: `node:test` via `tsx`; CI: typecheck + lint + format:check + test
- Package manager: npm

## Directory Structure
```
src/app/                 # App Router pages + API routes
src/auth/                # Auth.js config
src/lib/                 # Domain (auth, money, orders, notifications, workshop, files)
migrations/              # 001_init … 004_order_items_name + seed.sql
docs/DKPrint-CRM-TZ-v1.md
OPS.md / HANDOFF.md      # SoT map, smoke, status for agents
design-system/dkprint-crm/
.cursor/rules/           # invariants + platform SoT/contracts/auth + pre-push
```

## Commands
- `npm run dev` / `build` / `start`
- `npm test` / `lint` / `typecheck` / `format:check`
- DB: apply `migrations/*.sql` in order, then `npm run seed:admin`
- Optional: `CONFIRM_SEED_DEMO=yes npm run seed:demo`

## Conventions
- Alias `@/*` → `./src/*`
- Flat `app/` + `lib/`; no repository/CQRS layers
- Money only via `lib/money`; status via `status_transitions`
- R2 key uses **orderNumber**, not order UUID
- Unit tests colocated as `*.test.ts` under `src/lib/`

## Key Files
- `docs/DKPrint-CRM-TZ-v1.md` — product/tech SoT (v1.5)
- `OPS.md` / `HANDOFF.md` — ops + agent handoff
- `src/lib/auth/permissions.ts`, `assertOrderAccess.ts`, `requireAuth.ts`
- `src/lib/money/index.ts`
- `src/lib/notifications/telegram.ts` — live TG card
- `src/lib/workshop/queue.ts`
- `.env.example`

## Agent rules
- `00-dkprint-invariants`, `02-project-defaults`, `04-safety`
- `03-pre-push-checks` — run full CI before push
- `05-source-of-truth`, `06-integration-contracts`, `07-auth-webhooks-access`
